author ai
group features/gui
note The Xrefs panel lists what calls the focused symbol (Xrefs to), what it calls (Xrefs from), and every reference the language's server reports. Clicking a caller or callee focuses that symbol the way a Symbols row does: it selects the matching step of the path being read, or opens the Listing on it. Clicking a reference opens its file in the Listing at that line. While the symbol's file waits for its server, the rows are dimmed and caller and callee clicks do nothing.

